{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-030","type":"group","x":980,"y":440,"width":620,"height":260,"label":"困難案例才加開的候選（opt-in，adaptive）"},
		{"id":"node-002","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-60,"width":340,"height":400,"label":"初始化來源 (擇一)"},
		{"id":"node-001","type":"text","text":"# Electro Pipeline 架構圖\n對應 `d:\\ICCAD-2026-C\\collaborate\\electro_optimized\\` — 每次 pipeline 有結構性改動（新增階段/新增預設開啟的機制）就更新這張圖。各方塊意義見同資料夾的 `Electronic_Pipeline.md`。","x":0,"y":-200,"width":1140,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-003","type":"text","text":"**Random init**\n`ELECTRO_JACOBI_MODE=off`\n隨機初始座標","x":0,"y":-20,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-004","type":"text","text":"**Jacobi 暖啟動**\n（生產預設 `replace`）\nb2b 連線圖做 20 輪鄰居平均","x":0,"y":90,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-005","type":"text","text":"**Spectral / GiFt**\n（opt-in，`ELECTRO_SPECTRAL=1`）\nanchored quadratic placement\n一步求解線性系統","x":0,"y":220,"width":260,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-010","type":"text","text":"## Stage 1\n**analytical_place()**\nAdam 梯度下降\nov / bb / wl / grp(0.4) / mib_shape(0.05)","x":380,"y":60,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-011","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2\n**legalize()**\n1. 順序抽取\n2. 貪婪 或 LP 壓實（`ELECTRO_LEGALIZE_LP=1` 生產預設）\n3. `_cleanup()` 保底（`_PUSH_GAP=1e-4`）","x":680,"y":60,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-020","type":"text","text":"**place-compact**（生產預設開，`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`）\n把這一輪結果的中心點當新初始化，再跑一輪短版 analytical_place（iters=400）→ 額外候選\n本季最大單一突破：2.1230→1.9666","x":680,"y":280,"width":560,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-040","type":"text","text":"**Proxy Cost 排名**\n預設：池平均正規化\nopt-in 池無關：`ELECTRO_PROXY_ABSAREA` / `ABSHPWL`\n(area/total_block_area, hpwl/√total_block_area)","x":680,"y":540,"width":260,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-050","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio 選擇\n每個候選都算一次 proxy cost，**逐案挑最低者送出**——不是調出單一最佳參數，是同時養一群候選","x":380,"y":730,"width":860,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-012","type":"text","text":"## Stage 3\n**soft_repair()**\nboundary snap / wide-swap（預設開）\ngrouping push-past（預設開）","x":980,"y":60,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-031","type":"text","text":"**adaptive spectral**\n`ELECTRO_SPECTRAL_ADAPTIVE=1`\n只有 `best_600_score ≥ THRESH`（預設 1.5）才加跑 spectral 候選","x":1000,"y":470,"width":280,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-033","type":"text","text":"最佳已驗證組合：adaptive-spectral + escalated(SEED=3) + 池無關 proxy = **1.7279**（~2×runtime，opt-in，非預設）","x":1000,"y":600,"width":580,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-032","type":"text","text":"**escalated adaptive-seed**\n`ELECTRO_ADAPTIVE_SEED=N`\n給難案例加 N 個額外 jacobi seed","x":1300,"y":470,"width":280,"height":110,"color":"1"}
	],
